    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Zico, vingt ans, gar\u00e7on \u00e0 toute \u00e9preuve, mi grande gueule, mi romantique, se fantasme une carri\u00e8re de marin. Jeunesse est le r\u00e9cit de sa premi\u00e8re travers\u00e9e en mer, du Havre \u00e0 Luanda, \u00e0 bord d\u2019un cargo d\u00e9glingu\u00e9, command\u00e9 par des bras cass\u00e9s. Il va rapidement d\u00e9chanter. C\u2019est l\u2019histoire d\u2019un r\u00eave obstin\u00e9, le voyage initiatique d\u2019un adolescent vers l\u2019\u00e2ge adulte.",
        "english": "Twenty-year-old Zico is a guy ready for anything. Half-loudmouth, half-romantic, he fantasizes about a sailor career. The Young One is the story of his first sea crossing, from Le Havre to Luanda, on board a rundown cargo ship, run by no-hopers. He quickly becomes disenchanted. It is the story of a stubborn dream, the journey of initiation from adolescence to adult life."
